{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果首款摺疊手機iPhone Duo今晚（16日）8時開始預售。</p><p>內媒報道，該款手機已迅速在京東、天貓等平台售罄。</p><p>在預售啟動數分鐘後，iPhone Duo多個版本的市場成交價已突破2萬元（人民幣，下同）。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T15:40:13.609277+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T14:53:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T00:57:35.205087+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T15:37:45.137240+00:00","content_hash":"2599b1b94e1a022d9f700ebca36fbc71af82bac6e44186b45137f742052e0b51","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}